WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.591
Snake Arena puts everyone's snake on the same board. Two to eight players, and it's as tense as it sounds.

2
00:00:08.291 --> 00:00:13.398
Steer with the arrow keys, WASD, the on-screen pad, or just swipe on the board.

3
00:00:13.548 --> 00:00:19.221
Eat the apples to grow longer. But hit a wall, your own tail, or another snake, and you're out.

4
00:00:19.921 --> 00:00:25.687
When a snake crashes, it turns into food for the survivors, so staying alive pays off.

5
00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:31.095
Last snake slithering wins the round, and the first to enough round wins takes the game.
